// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/InfoNPCs/_src/Incarnate_Info_NPC.xls 	Sheet : Incarnate_NPC_Ouroboros_H 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1237107603" "<em=lecture f=a>Ah, {HeroName}, I have some information on how to unlock your inner Incarnate if you are interested."
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
"P2472547989" "I'm terribly sorry, {HeroName}, but you and I have nothing to talk about."
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable Leave :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EndGameInfoDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page RamielIntro Text :
"P2144422968" "<color deepskyblue>Mender Ramiel</color><br><br>Greetings from the future, {HeroName}. I'm here to help you understand the various features of unlocking your inner Incarnate.<br><br>Is there something specific I can help you with?"
// Answer Text :
"P453325084" "What is an Incarnate?"
// Answer Text :
"P3955145277" "How do I become an Incarnate?"
// Answer Text :
"P879886117" "What is an Incarnate Slot?"
// Answer Text :
"P3785588462" "What is an Incarnate Ability?"
// Answer Text :
"P44754980" "What are Incarnate Components?"
// Answer Text :
"P2562600795" "How do I get Incarnate Components?"
// Answer Text :
"P4195638956" "How do I create Incarnate Abilities?"
// Answer Text :
"P2629924474" "How do I create more powerful Incarnate Abilities?"
// Answer Text :
"P405491381" "Who are you?"
// Page WhoIsRamiel Text :
"P163647470" "My name is Mender Ramiel, and I am from a far future version of Ouroboros. In this future, I have seen the efforts of Mender Silos here in this time period have some real effect. The Coming Storm is weakened, and it seems that this is because of the powered beings of this time unlocking their inner Incarnate, the same power that fuels Statesman and Lord Recluse. I have traveled back to this time to inform Mender Silos of this."
// Answer Text :
"P2208466700" "What do you mean by 'unlocking their inner Incarnate?'"
// Answer Text :
"P2838854197" "I have another question."
// Page WhatIsIncarnate Text :
"P3909199148" "I am no expert but it seems that the Well of Furies is being directed to infuse its power into worthy individuals of this time period. It does not matter what your origin is, nor if you are hero, villain, vigilante, or rogue, it seems the most powerful people are being granted the ability to unlock their inner incarnate and gain new powers and abilities, strengthening them for some upcoming battle."
// Page BecomeIncarnate Text :
"P3981185212" "I have discussed this with several people of this time period. It seems that completing the toughest tasks this time period has to offer is the key to unlocking your first, or Alpha, abilities. Alpha abilities are the first Incarnate abilities anyone seems to be able to use. I would suggest forming a strong team and doing tasks for Statesman, Lady Grey, Imperious, or Dr. Khan, or perhaps raiding the crashed Rikti Mothership or defeating the latest incarnation of Hamidon.<br><br>I have even heard stories of single heroes unlocking their Alpha by simply sacrificing other rewards they have merited."
// Answer Text :
"P2845704699" "What do you mean by 'Alpha'?"
// Page IncarnateSlot Text :
"P54379711" "The beings of this time have referred to their Alpha abilities fitting into an 'Alpha Slot'. I believe this is simply a way of saying that you can only have one Alpha ability active at a time, and therefore you must 'slot it' into your Alpha slot to make it the active, dominate, ability."
// Answer Text :
"P3857725329" "Are there more slots than just Alpha?"
// Page MoreSlots Text :
"P2210935906" "In my time, I have seen heroes and villains with slots they referred to as: Judgement, Interface, Lore, Destiny, Hybrid, Genesis, Stance, Vitae, and Omega. I believe it is only a matter of time before heroes and villains of this time can unlock these slots and abilities as well."
// Answer Text :
"P1254761627" "What exactly is an Incarnate ability?"
// Page IncarnateAbility Text :
"P3977081199" "An Incarnate ability is a power that you place into a slot.<br><br>To see your slot and your abilities, simply open your Powers Window and click the 'Incarnate Abilities' at the top of that window.<br><br>To slot in a new ability, double click it on the list to the right, this will place it into the appropriate slot. There is a cooldown after slotting an ability of 5 minutes. During this time you can not re-slot that same slot again.<br><br>  You can have many powers at your disposal for a given slot, but only have one active at a time.  The ability will be replaced with the new one, but you can still go back to the old one if you would like. It is not destroyed in the process."
// Answer Text :
"P2116390729" "How do I get new Incarnate abilities?"
// Page IncarnateComponents Text :
"P1717978456" "Incarnate components are used to construct new Incarnate abilities. There are several categories of components, Common, Uncommon, Rare, and Very Rare. Each Incarnate ability is built from this pool of components. Components are very personal and only work for the person who found them, therefore they can not be traded or sold. Apparently whoever or whatever is directing the Well of Furies believes you should have to work for your newfound power."
// Answer Text :
"P4282356031" "Where do I get these Incarnate components?"
// Page GetIncarnateComponents Text :
"P52209881" "You can gain components in the same fashion as you originally unlocked your Alpha slot. You can also earn sub-components from defeating powerful enemies, including other heroes and villains, which can then be combined into a Common component."
// Page CreateIncarnateAbilities Text :
"P3987368209" "In the same place where you slot your Alpha Abilities, there is a button labeled 'Maek Stuff'. By choosing that you will bring up an interface that the crafters of this time period are familiar with.<br><br>Simply select the category that you wish to work within, either your Alpha or Converting, then select the recipe you wish to create. A list of required materials will be shown, and if you have all of the required ones on you, simply click the 'buy' button and you will create that ability or component.<br><br>If you have subcomponents and wish to create Incarnate components you can do that under the Conversion section of the UI."
// Page CreateMoreIncarnateAbilities Text :
"P1726869727" "In order for you to create the 'Uncommon' abilities you must first have the Common ability related to that Uncommon one. For example, Cardiac Boost, a Common Alpha ability, is required to create Cardiac Core Boost. The crafting will also require Uncommon Incarnate components, which can only be created by converting Common components into what you need."
// Page RamielMoreHelp Text :
"P3872389801" "Although I am a time traveler, my time is not infinite& what else can I answer for you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2128794663" "Who is Mender Silos?"
// Answer Text :
"P745660641" "What is the Coming Storm?"
// Page WhoIsMenderSilos Text :
"P1779634085" "Mender Silos holds many secrets, and he likes to think his identity is one of them. Many have ventured that he is actually Lord Nemesis, and I can confirm that as one of his previous aliases.<br><br>But I must caution you, the Lord Nemesis of this time and Mender Silos may be the same person, but they are hundreds of thousands of years removed from one another. People change, and the Menders of Ouroboros follow a leader who knows that what he did in the past was wrong and is trying to correct those mistakes."
// Page WhatIsComingStorm Text :
"P3851396974" "Some things you will just have to learn for yourself. And besides, if we are successful here in Ouroboros, the Coming Storm may never come to pass."
// Page Fallback Text :
"P1973422405" "um? What was I saying?"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

