"P1721519682" "I have discussed this with several people of this time period. It seems that completing the toughest tasks this time period has to offer is the key to unlocking your Alpha abilities. Alpha abilities are the first Incarnate abilities anyone seems to be able to use. I would suggest forming a strong team and doing tasks for Lord Recluse, Lady Grey, Imperious, or Barracuda, or perhaps raiding the crashed Rikti Mothership or defeating the latest incarnation of Hamidon."
